  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You halve any penalties to your Bluff, Diplomacy, Handle Animal, Intimidate, Linguistics, or Perform skill checks for targeting a creature of animal level intelligence, a different size category, a different social class or culture, or a different creature type. You likewise halve any increase to a DC or a bonus opponents get to their opposed skill checks in those circumstances.</p>\n<p>You also reduce by 2 any bonus to saving throws a creature gets due to its creature type against your mind-affecting effect (such as hideous laughter or a creature that gets a bonus for being targeted when otherwise immune via Communication Breakthrough).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/communication#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
